// Nyria example: an indicator that sends a JSON alert with alert().
//
// Where the webhook URL goes
//   1. In Nyria, create a strategy with TradingView as the alert source. Open its
//      Integration tab and copy the webhook URL. It has the form
//      https://trades.nyria.io/webhooks/<your-strategy-token>
//   2. Add this script to a chart, then open the alert dialog (Alt+A, or Option+A on a Mac).
//   3. Condition: this indicator, "Any alert() function call".
//   4. Notifications: tick "Webhook URL" and paste the URL from step 1.
//   5. Create the alert.
//
// The text each alert() call passes is the message that is posted to the URL. The script builds
// the JSON from syminfo.ticker, so it needs no {{ticker}} placeholder. One alert on the
// indicator covers every alert() call below.
//
// Messages this script sends for SPY:
//   {"action": "OPEN", "instrument": "SPY", "direction": "LONG"}
//   {"action": "CLOSE", "instrument": "SPY", "direction": "LONG"}
//
// Nyria sets the order size from the bot's budget per entry, so the message carries no size.
// Check a message in https://nyria.io/tools/alert-tester before the alert goes live, and run
// the strategy on a paper bot first.
//@version=6
indicator("Nyria alert() example: SMA cross", overlay = true)

fastLength = input.int(9, "Fast SMA length", minval = 1)
slowLength = input.int(21, "Slow SMA length", minval = 2)

fast = ta.sma(close, fastLength)
slow = ta.sma(close, slowLength)

plot(fast, "Fast SMA", color = color.teal)
plot(slow, "Slow SMA", color = color.orange)

// syminfo.ticker is the bare ticker (SPY); syminfo.tickerid would add the exchange prefix.
nyriaMessage(string action, string direction) =>
    '{"action": "' + action + '", "instrument": "' + syminfo.ticker + '", "direction": "' + direction + '"}'

openLong = ta.crossover(fast, slow)
closeLong = ta.crossunder(fast, slow)

// alert.freq_once_per_bar_close sends the message only when the bar has closed.
if openLong
    alert(nyriaMessage("OPEN", "LONG"), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)

if closeLong
    alert(nyriaMessage("CLOSE", "LONG"), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
